data.content:
## .NET 10 OpenAPI Breaking Changes

The root cause is **Microsoft.OpenApi was upgraded from v1.x to v2.x**, which has major API changes. Here's what broke and how to fix each piece:

### 1. `OpenApiString` / `IOpenApiAny` → `JsonNode`
The `Microsoft.OpenApi.Any` types (`OpenApiString`, `OpenApiInteger`, etc.) are **removed**. Use `System.Text.Json.Nodes` instead:

```csharp
// Before
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Any;
param.Schema.Example = new OpenApiString("1.0");

// After
using System.Text.Json.Nodes;
param.Schema.Example = JsonValue.Create("1.0");
```

### 2. `schema.Nullable` → `JsonSchemaType.Null` flag
OpenApi v2 targets OpenAPI 3.1, which uses JSON Schema–style nullable (a type union) instead of a boolean:

```csharp
// Before
property.Value.Nullable = false;

// After — remove Null from the type flags
property.Value.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null;
```

(To *set* nullable: `schema.Type |= JsonSchemaType.Null`)

### 3. `OpenApiReference.Type` → use `ReferenceType3`
The enum was renamed to distinguish OpenAPI 3.x references:

```csharp
// Before
Reference = new OpenApiReference { Type = ReferenceType.SecurityScheme, Id = "oauth2" }

// After
Reference = new OpenApiReference { Type = ReferenceType3.SecurityScheme, Id = "oauth2" }
```

### 4. `OpenApiSecurityRequirement` is no longer a `Dictionary`
It no longer inherits from `Dictionary<OpenApiSecurityScheme, IList<string>>`. Use the `Schemes` property:

```csharp
// Before
operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
{
    new() { [oAuthScheme] = scopes }
};

// After
operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
{
    new()
    {
        Schemes = new Dictionary<OpenApiSecurityScheme, IList<string>>
        {
            [oAuthScheme] = scopes
        }
    }
};
```

### Fixed code (complete)

```csharp
using System.Text.Json.Nodes;
using Microsoft.OpenApi.Models;

options.AddOperationTransformer((operation, context, ct) =>
{
    var param = operation.Parameters.FirstOrDefault(p => p.Name == "api-version");
    if (param is not null)
    {
        param.Schema.Example = JsonValue.Create("1.0");
    }

    operation.Responses.TryAdd("401", new OpenApiResponse { Description = "Unauthorized" });

    var oAuthScheme = new OpenApiSecurityScheme
    {
        Reference = new OpenApiReference { Type = ReferenceType3.SecurityScheme, Id = "oauth2" }
    };
    operation.Security = new List<OpenApiSecurityRequirement>
    {
        new()
        {
            Schemes = new Dictionary<OpenApiSecurityScheme, IList<string>>
            {
                [oAuthScheme] = scopes
            }
        }
    };

    return Task.CompletedTask;
});

options.AddSchemaTransformer((schema, context, ct) =>
{
    if (schema.Properties is not null)
    {
        foreach (var property in schema.Properties)
        {
            if (schema.Required?.Contains(property.Key) != true)
                property.Value.Type &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null;
        }
    }
    return Task.CompletedTask;
});
```

**Summary of the 4 changes:**
| v1 (`.NET 9`) | v2 (`.NET 10`) |
|---|---|
| `new OpenApiString(...)` | `JsonValue.Create(...)` |
| `schema.Nullable = bool` | `schema.Type \|= / &= ~JsonSchemaType.Null` |
| `ReferenceType.SecurityScheme` | `ReferenceType3.SecurityScheme` |
| `new OpenApiSecurityRequirement { [scheme] = scopes }` | `new OpenApiSecurityRequirement { Schemes = ... }` |
